• Examined the appropriateness of the Holding Company’s calculation for identification of assets and liabilities (including components of other equity related to these assets and liabilities) pertaining to demerged undertaking transferred to TML at their respective carrying values as appearing in the books of the Holding Company as per the Scheme;
